#showas:混乱特工
Warning:  this scenario contains a faction that is highly annoying to many players.  Partake at your own risk.  You have been warned.  

Agents of Chaos introduces the controversial Chromatic Horror.  It travels the galaxy, indiscriminately relocating even normally immovable structures when it shows up, and also cancelling any local cease-fires that the Zenith Trader may have been enforcing.  

The Horror will be joined by a Devourer Golem, just to add a bit more aromatic flavor.  

A Cyclone Realistic map of standard 80-map size and the default Classic fleet are at your disposal here.  The AIs have decided to be a bit chaotic themselves;  one is Random Easier and another Random Moderate so nothing too severe, but exactly what you get depends on the luck of the draw.  

Patience is a virtue.  Remember that.  